diff --git a/third_party/remotion-composer/SCENE_TYPES.md b/third_party/remotion-composer/SCENE_TYPES.md
index 74217a4..f6af2ca 100644
--- a/third_party/remotion-composer/SCENE_TYPES.md
+++ b/third_party/remotion-composer/SCENE_TYPES.md
@@ -4,13 +4,17 @@ Authoritative list of `cut.type` and `overlay.type` values the `Explainer` compo
 
 When you add a new component, append it here and in `src/components/index.ts`.
 
+`Explainer` also accepts optional `captionStyle` overrides: `color`,
+`highlightColor`, `backgroundColor`, `fontSize`, and `wordsPerPage`. Omitted
+values retain the selected theme defaults.
+
 ---
 
 ## Cut types (`cut.type`)
 
 | `type` | Component | Required fields | Common fields | Purpose |
 |---|---|---|---|---|
-| *(none — video)* | `OffthreadVideo` | `source` (path to mp4) | `source_in_seconds`, `animation` (zoom-in, ken-burns), `in_seconds`, `out_seconds` | Play an MP4 clip directly |
+| *(none — video)* | `OffthreadVideo` | `source` (path to mp4) | `source_in_seconds`, `source_audio` (defaults false), `source_vignette` (defaults true), `animation`, `in_seconds`, `out_seconds` | Play an MP4 clip directly; source-led edits explicitly opt into audio and may disable the decorative vignette |
 | *(none — image)* | `Img` | `source` (path to png/jpg) | `animation`, `in_seconds`, `out_seconds` | Play a still with Ken Burns |
 | `text_card` | `TextCard` | `text` | `fontSize`, `backgroundVideo`, `backgroundOverlay`, `color` | Large-typography beat |
 | `hero_title` | `HeroTitle` | `text` | `heroSubtitle`, `heroAccentText`, `backgroundColor`, `backgroundVideo`, `backgroundOverlay` | Title/end card; accent defaults to the first word |
@@ -25,6 +29,10 @@ When you add a new component, append it here and in `src/components/index.ts`.
 | `anime_scene` | `AnimeScene` | `images` (list) | `particles`, `lightingFrom`, `lightingTo`, `vignette` | Still-image anime scene with particles + camera motion |
 | **`terminal_scene`** | **`TerminalScene`** | **`steps`** (list of cmd/out/pause/pill) | **`terminalTitle`, `prompt`, `accentColor`** | **Synthetic terminal animation — no real capture needed. See the bundle's `skills/visual-planning.md` and `skills/motion-craft.md`.** |
 | **`screenshot_scene`** | **`ScreenshotScene`** | **`backgroundImage`** (path in `public/`), **`screenshotSteps`** (list of overlays) | **`screenshotSize` (natural px w/h), `cursorStartAt`, `accentColor`** | **Screenshot-led synthetic UI with cursor, click, typing, highlight, and callout overlays. Coordinates are normalized (0–1) against the contain-fit rect. See the bundle's `skills/product-truth.md`.** |
+| `year_verdict` | `YearVerdict` | `verdictItems` | `headline`, `keptColor`, `removedColor`, `fontSize` | Compare years or cases and resolve each to a kept/skipped verdict |
+| `number_reveal` | `NumberReveal` | `numberRows` | `caption`, `footnote`, `revealDurationSeconds`, `emphasisColor` | Align numeric rows and reveal the decimal or digit that explains a correction |
+| `year_grid` | `YearGrid` | none (defaults to 400 cells) | `gridTotal`, `gridColumns`, `gridEveryNth`, `removedOrdinals`, timing/colors | Show periodic selection and visible subtraction without deleting evidence |
+| `rule_card` | `RuleCard` | `ruleLead`, `ruleEmphasis` | `ruleTail`, `chips`, `emphasisAtSeconds` | State a rule with one emphasized clause and supporting kept/skipped examples |
 
 ---
 
